        {
          "id": "h1",
          "type": "look",
          "content": "$(AB) \\parallel (CD)$ : $\\dfrac{OB}{OD} = \\dfrac{AB}{CD}$ ، و $OD = OB + 6$ ."
        },
        {
          "id": "h2",
          "type": "direction",
          "content": "اكتب $\\dfrac{OB}{OB + 6} = \\dfrac{2}{5}$ ثم استعمل الجداء المتصالب."
        }
      ],
      "feedback": {
        "correct": "$5OB = 2OB + 12$ ومنه $OB = 4\\,\\mathrm{m}$ .",
        "incorrect": "$OD$ ليس $6$ : $OD = OB + BD$ . المجهول $OB$ يظهر في الطرفين."
      },
      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "بما أن $(AB) \\parallel (CD)$ ، حسب خاصية طالس: $\\dfrac{OB}{OD} = \\dfrac{OA}{OC} = \\dfrac{AB}{CD}$",
          "$\\dfrac{OB}{OB + 6} = \\dfrac{2}{5}$",
          "$5 \\times OB = 2 \\times OB + 12$",
          "$3 \\times OB = 12$"
        ],
        "result": "OB = 4\\,\\mathrm{m}"
      },
      "work": "optional",
